{"type":"turn_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Alright. Next, I'll check the worklist for details of the host-tooling task, the OVERSEER-LAUNCH.md handoff for orchestration context, and check container/build.sh and the Containerfile to understand how to run the containers (mounts, devices) so that fn-cluster-up correctly starts the containers. I'll also check the existing files under host/ (rdma-related). Furthermore, I'll check the contents of tests/test_instruments.py to match the test style. Let me check the host-tooling entry in the worklist and its gate wiring.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_c3f79eb219b543bea0574d27","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /home/tom/.local/state/tally/campaigns/flashnext/flashnext/57f87640bc5b/host-tooling && python3 - <<'PY'\nimport json\nwl = json.load(open(\"silent-factory-worklists/flashnext.json\"))\nfor t in wl[\"tasks\"]:\n    print(t[\"id\"], \"|\", t.get(\"kind\"), \"|\", t.get(\"title\"))\nprint(\"---gates---\")\nfor g in wl.get(\"gates\", []):\n    print(g.get(\"id\"), g.get(\"run\") or g.get(\"argv\") or \"\")\nPY"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_0ed6a538ddcb4be1acbd445f","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/tom/.local/state/tally/campaigns/flashnext/flashnext/57f87640bc5b/host-tooling/handoff/OVERSEER-LAUNCH.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"qwen-token-plan","model":"qwen3.8-max","usage":{"input":3104,"output":344,"cacheRead":34816,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":117,"totalTokens":38264,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1787988719820,"responseId":"chatcmpl-d0df294b-bbf3-46c0-9455-e6c7eb214fea","rawStopReason":"tool_calls"},"toolResults":[{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_c3f79eb219b543bea0574d27","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"container-recipe | implementation | Container recipe: pinned wheel set + engine fork built from so