{"type":"tool_execution_update","toolCallId":"call_39d074d483544e60b013a530","toolName":"bash","args":{"command":"cd /home/tom/.local/state/tally/campaigns/flashnext/flashnext/57f87640bc5b/host-tooling && grep -n \"ple\\|PLE\\|engram\\|table\" patches/0010-ROCm-Wire-VLLM_PLE_MMAP-and-the-FP8-PLE-stack-into-t.patch | head -30"},"partialResult":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"2:From: work-ple <work-ple@flashnext.local>\n4:Subject: [PATCH 10/12] [ROCm] Wire VLLM_PLE_MMAP and the FP8 PLE stack into\n7:Before this, on a ROCm build VLLM_PLE_MMAP=1 was a silent no-op: the amd/\n8:tree never imported ple_mmap, the custom op was never registered, and the\n13:amd/ple_layer.py\n15:  W2  'from ..common import ple_mmap' (module-scope, so the op registers\n19:      ple_mmap.enabled() -> check_cudagraph_safety + validate_shards_for +\n23:      VLLM_PLE_MMAP=0 (the default) is the kill switch.\n30:      load-bearing: ple_mmap's op body probes for it to decide whether\n31:      layer_name resolves to a PLE layer.\n33:      ple_mmap.set_weight_scale (the placeholder has no such Parameter for\n38:Blocker A -- the FP8 PLE stack, ported at full parity from nvidia/:\n39:  Qwen4ExpPLEFp8EmbeddingMethod, _get_ple_embedding_quant_method,\n40:  Qwen4ExpPLELayer._get_embedding_weight_scale / _dequantize_embeddings,\n43:  _dequantize_embeddings call in the PLE forward before key_proj/value_proj.\n46:  copy_ple_embedding_shard_ bare-casts FP8 -> bf16, doubling the bytes and\n54:  which equals params_dtype for an unquantized table.\n61:amd/model.py: get_current_vllm_config import, the ple_mmap import, and the\n62:two 5-line build_tables blocks after load_weights. amd/model.py is now\n65:tests/models/qwen4_exp/test_ple_mmap_amd.py: new, no GPU and no ROCm\n66:runtime required. Pins that both trees reach the same ple_mmap module\n71:raise when an FP8 table has no scale).\n78: tests/models/qwen4_exp/test_ple_mmap_amd.py | 352 ++++++++++++++++++++\n80: vllm/models/qwen4_exp/amd/ple_layer.py      | 254 +++++++++++++-\n81: vllm/models/qwen4_exp/common/ple_mmap.py    |  11 +-\n83: create mode 100644 tests/models/qwen4_exp/test_ple_mmap_amd.py\n85:diff --git a/tests/models/qwen4_exp/test_ple_mmap_amd.py b/tests/models/qwen4_exp/test_ple_mmap_amd.py\n89:+++ b/tests/models/qwen4_exp/test_ple_mmap_amd.py\n93:+\"\"\"VLLM_PLE_MMAP and the FP8 PLE stack on the ROCm (amd/) model tree.\n96:+the ``amd/`` tree is imported instead, ``ple_mmap`` was never imported, the\n"}],"details":{}}}
