ap_amd.py\n89:+++ b/tests/models/qwen4_exp/test_ple_mmap_amd.py\n93:+\"\"\"VLLM_PLE_MMAP and the FP8 PLE stack on the ROCm (amd/) model tree.\n96:+the ``amd/`` tree is imported instead, ``ple_mmap`` was never imported, the\n"}]},"isError":false}
