{"type":"message_update","assistantMessageEvent":{"type":"thinking_end","contentIndex":0,"content":"Wait a sec — in run-tp2.sh, the python heredoc references the environment variable RECEIPTS, but we never once export RECEIPTS inside run-tp2.sh. RECEIPTS is a bash variable, and `export FN_API` is done but `export RECEIPTS` isn't. We need to export RECEIPTS (and FIDELITY_DIR is already exported before the fidelity step — good). Let's add `export RECEIPTS` after the mkdir. Also, the heredoc uses os.environ[\"RECEIPTS\"] — needs to be exported. Fix.\n\nFurthermore, in the context step heredoc, FN_CONTEXT_TARGET and FN_CTX_DECODE are referenced via os.environ.get — no problem (defaults exist).\n\nAlso inside the tp2 heredoc: `pre[\"data\"]` — the data in preflight.json is written by preflight. No problem.\n\nFixing the export.\n"}}
