py of the repo root? The script computes REPO_ROOT from SCRIPT_DIR/.. and writes to results/receipts/preflight.json — writing to results/ in the working tree is out of the write boundary for commits, but uncommitted scratch artifacts in the working tree pollute git status. Workaround: copy host/ into a sandbox directory structure $S/host + $S/results and run the copied script. The script is self-contained (sources fn-env.sh via SCRIPT_DIR).\n\nLet's run it.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Now an end-to-end dry run of `fn-preflight.sh` in a sandbox with shims for `ssh`, `ip`, `ping`, `systemctl`, `sudo`, `od`:\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_d37557d75ed0460aa1f8e5b5","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"set -e; S=$(mktemp -d); R=/home/tom/.local/state/tally/campaigns/flashnext/flashnext/57f87640bc5b/host-tooling\nmkdir -p \"$S/host\" \"$S/bin\"\ncp \"$R/host/fn-env.sh\" \"$R/host/fn-preflight.sh\" \"$S/host/\"\nsed -i 's|/sys/class/net/|'\"$S\"'/sysnet/|g' \"$S/host/fn-env.sh\"\nmkdir -p \"$S/sysnet/thunderbolt0\" \"$S/sysnet/thunderbolt1\"\ncat > \"$S/bin/ip\" <<'EOF'\n#!/usr/bin/env bash\ncase \"$*\" in\n  *thunderbolt0*) echo \"thunderbolt0  UP  10.99.0.1/30\" ;;\n  *thunderbolt1*) echo \"thunderbolt1  UP  169.254.5.6/16\" ;;\nesac\nEOF\ncat > \"$S/bin/ssh\" <<'EOF'\n#!/usr/bin/env bash\nshift; exec bash -c \"$*\"\nEOF\ncat > \"$S/bin/systemctl\" <<'EOF'\n#!/usr/bin/env bash\n[ \"$1\" = is-active ] && echo active\nEOF\ncat > \"$S/bin/ping\" <<'EOF'\n#!/usr/bin/env bash\necho \"PING ignored\"; echo \"rtt min/avg/max/mdev = 58.0/77.2/112.0/9.1 ms\"\nEOF\ncat > \"$S/bin/sudo\" <<'EOF'\n#!/usr/bin/env bash\nshift; exec \"$@\"\nEOF\ncat > \"$S/bin/od\" <<'EOF'\n#!/usr/bin/env bash\necho \"           0\"\nEOF\nchmod +x \"$S/bin/\"*\nPATH=\"$S/bin:$PATH\" HOME=\"$S/home\" bash \"$S/host/fn-preflight.sh\" 2>&1 | tail -12\necho \"=== receipt ===\"; cat \"$S/results/receipts/preflight.json\"\nrm -rf \"$S\""}}],"api":"openai-completions"