{"type":"message_update","assistantMessageEvent":{"type":"toolcall_end","contentIndex":1,"toolCall":{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_8ef03cb694884b6e87a46e53","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /home/tom/.local/state/tally/campaigns/flashnext/flashnext/57f87640bc5b/host-tooling && git add host/fn-env.sh host/fn-cluster-up.sh host/fn-cluster-down.sh host/fn-preflight.sh host/systemd/flashnext-pair.service scripts/run-tp2.sh tests/test_host_tooling.py && git commit -m \"host-tooling: Pair-service orchestration: env doctrine, cluster up/down, first-light runner\" -m \"host/fn-env.sh: the doctrine both ranks source — PYTHONHASHSEED=0,\nPYTORCH_HIP_ALLOC_CONF expandable_segments at 0.85, HSA_ENABLE_INTERRUPT=1,\ninductor/triton caches under the state dir (never tmpfs), NCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME\nCOMPUTED per node from ip -br addr (only rails with a routable /30; the\npeerless rail 1 stays out until it has a peer IP and the choice is logged),\nNCCL_IB_DISABLE=1 unconditionally (the ibverbs devices are present by design;\nsockets are the transport of record until host/rdma/ab-protocol.md's attended\nA/B), VLLM_RAY_EXTRA_ENV_VAR_PREFIXES_TO_COPY=FN_, VLLM_PLE_MMAP=1, and a\nloud F.9 banner against exporting is-set-probe defaults.\n\nhost/fn-cluster-up.sh: reap-then-gate on both nodes, containers on both nodes\n(worker over ssh on the wire 10.99.9.2), ray head+join with the python pool\ncapped at RAY_NUM_CPUS, a hard two-GPU gate before serve, then the TP=2 eager\nserve of /var/lib/local-models/flashnext-fp8 as 'flashnext' behind a\nwait-for-reality API poll. host/fn-cluster-down.sh: idempotent both-node\nteardown, always exit 0. host/fn-preflight.sh: byte-diff of both ranks'\ndoctrine env, latency-hold device reads on both ends, per-rail link speeds,\nround-trip probes on both rails vs the 200 us budget, receipt written.\n\nhost/systemd/flashnext-pair.service: oneshot + RemainAfterExit, ExecStopPost\nteardown (ExecStop never runs when ExecStart fails), no install section —\nthe pair comes up only on an explicit start.\n\nscripts/run-tp2.sh: preflight, up, two greedy 300-token completions\nbyte-compared (tp2.json), residency after 50 warmed decode tokens with GTT\nfrom sysfs + rank RSS + table page-cache residency and the mmap engagement\nprobe (residency.json), fixed-prompt losses and frontier logits under\nresults/fidelity/ (fidelity.json), the 262144-context decode probe\n(context.json) — all four receipts per the receipts-verify.py schema.\n\ntests/test_host_tooling.py: doctrine lines, computed-not-hardcoded rails,\nunconditional IB disable, no probe-read exports (F.9), unit teardown-safety\nand boot-freedom, syntax hygiene, reap-before-gate order.\n\nVerified on the coordinator: the live rail computation lists thunderbolt0\n(10.99.0.1/30) and excludes thunderbolt1 (169.254/16 link-local).\" && git log --oneline -2 && git status --porcelain; echo \"worktree clean: $?\""}}}}
