om `ip -br addr`** — verified against the **live coordinator**: lists `thunderbolt0` (10.99.0.1/30), excludes `thunderbolt1` (169.254.200.164/16 link-local), logs the choice; auto-admits rail 1 when it gets a peer IP (simulated).\n2. **`NCCL_IB_DISABLE=1` unconditional** — bare export, asserted as such by test.\n3. **No probe-read defaults exported** — notably `VLLM_ROCM_USE_AITER=0` (present in the donor env) was deliberately dropped per F.9.\n4. **Receipts match `receipts-verify.py` exactly** — validated with synthetic receipts both ways (pass path exit 0; a `null` table-residency probe correctly fails the gate).\n5. **Worker actions ride the wire** — ssh/ray dial `10.99.9.x` fleet identities, rails carry tensors only.\n6. **Reap-then-gate** — order enforced and asserted by test.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Task acceptance argv: **PASS** (bash -n ×6, all greps, 9 unit tests)\n- Full repo-tests gate: **29/29 OK** (including pre-existing invariants)\n- `receipts-verify.py`: clean (3 pre-existing receipts, 0 violations)\n- End-to-end preflight dry run (shimmed ssh/ip/ping/systemctl): fail and pass paths both behave; embedded Python blocks all compile\n\nNot pushed, not merged, no other worklist task read — the deterministic campaign nodes own those operations."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"qwen-token-plan","model":"qwen3.8-max","usage":{"input":4981,"output":1018,"cacheRead":105600,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":132,"totalTokens":111599,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1787989954362,"responseId":"chatcmpl-5fb180d9-9069-4958-9541-d5dd96067c4d","rawStopReason":"stop"}],"willRetry":false}
